                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A choice pantry set up like a small grocery store, with fresh produce from three local farms, milk, eggs and pantry staples. Bring a bag; we'll bring the coffee."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Pantry hours and address →",
                      "marks": [
