                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Homework Harbor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Volunteer tutors, a hot snack and a calm place to work for students in grades 3 to 8. Parents can pick up groceries from the pantry on the same visit."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
